 "description": "<p>A neck ring pairing a bow with a bell, in black or white. The jingle at movement is soft - present, not announcing. Weight is the design constraint the format lives or dies on, and this one stays light.</p>\n<p>The bow-and-bell combination suits cosplay outfits and intimate occasions equally, which is the dual life of most pieces in this category. Two colorways cover the sweet and the sleek.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Item type: neck ring with bow and bell</li>\n<li>Color: black or white</li>\n<li>Fit: one size</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pick the shade to match the headband. The finishing piece for cat and maid costumes that arrived without their neck detail.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Cute bow bell neck ring in black or white, light one-size build with soft jingle.</p>\n",
